Author: ycc738 <ycc738@andestech.com>
Date:   Tue May 26 16:49:22 2026 +0800

    feat: upgrade ax66 cpu wrappers to be compatible with latest 66 eng version

    1. version : ax66-engr-release-2026-05-16bhcl
    2. add mmr subordinate interface
    3. change int_src signal's width to 34
    4. update sys interface name to sys_msi

diff --git a/src/cpu_wrappers/ax66_cpu_cluster_subsystem.hpp b/src/cpu_wrappers/ax66_cpu_cluster_subsystem.hpp
